Modifications: a calibrated DeepSeek layer-0 shared expert is added as three
separate Q8_0 tensors. Input/output maps are folded into those tensors.
A custom runtime adds its clamped SwiGLU output to the original Qwen FFN
at scale 0.1. The Qwen base is converted/quantized to GGUF; original base
tensor shapes are preserved. Q4 uses Q4_K_M; Q8 uses Q8_0.
The shipped GGUF general.name strings retain the original experimental names.

